{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"agent_message","text":"The core loop is in place: three ingredient belts feed three customers, completed burgers build a tip combo, mistakes raise kitchen pressure, and the dinner bell buys a few calm seconds. The final rush adds warning-marked steam hazards. I’m adding the menus, live tuning tools, synthesized diner music, and input support next.\n"}}
