oon materials, orthographic cameras and AnimationMixer made a consistent illustrated diorama straightforward.','unknown','The complete cooking simulation, order UX, controller navigation, touch assistance and procedural audio.','Coordinating fixed simulation steps, Rapier bodies, native animation and two rendering backends in a single-file build.','none','A first-party controller-first UI and input layer would reduce custom infrastructure.'],\n 'promptFeedback':['The source, art direction, input philosophy and deliverable were concrete enough to support a coherent complete game.','Whether standalone multiplayer needed remote networking in addition to AI Hub sessions; this implementation provides couch co-op outside the hub.','Combining a polished single-file WebGPU game with accessible controls, an entire three-rush progression and tested multiplayer integration.','Specify whether standalone remote multiplayer is mandatory, and distinguish direct dependency/protocol downloads from prohibited internet research.'],\n 'aiHub':{'name':'Pressure Griller','tagline':'A little lunch. A lot of hustle.','description':'Catch conveyor toppings, stack the regulars’ burgers and hustle to the right counter in an inked 3D diner. Beat three escalating lunch rushes solo, share a kitchen with a friend, or compete for tips in AI Hub.','type':'Game','genre':'Action','source':'Pressure Cooker (1983)','series':'','players':'1–4','controls':'Move: left stick / WASD. Catch or serve: Cross / Space. Dash: Circle / Shift. Bell: Triangle / Q. Ticket: R1 / Tab. Clear tray: Square / R. P2: arrows / Enter. Touch: drag, assisted catching.','tags':['3d','arcade','cooking','co-op','retro','comedy']}}\np.write_text(json.dumps(data,indent=2))\nPY\nnpm run build\nnode --input-type=module - <<'JS'\nimport {Kitchen,autopilot} from './core.js';\nconst g=new Kitchen();g.start();for(let i=0;i<40000 && g.phase\"'!=='\"'result';i++)g.update(1/60,g.players.map(p=>autopilot(g,p)));console.log(g.snapshot());\nJS\"","aggregated_output":"npm notice run build\nnpm notice run node build.mjs\nPressure-Griller-Pressure-Cooker-1983-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-201537.html (2.90 MB, all dependencies embedded)\n{\n  phase: 'result',\n  mode: 'solo',\n  stage: 2,\n  remaining: 93.06666666666763,\n  clock: 33.799999999999365,\n  score: 7041,\n  pressure: 0,\n  bell: 100,\n  slow: 0,\n  combo: 12,\n  bestCombo: 12,\n  goal: 5,\n  servedThisShift: 5,\n  players: [\n    {\n      id: 0,\n      x: 3.6985107177756325,\n      z: 3.4550701912068593,\n      plate: [],\n      target: 2,\n      face: 1.3343517614429758,\n      dash: 1.4500000000000046,\n      dashTime: 0,\n      stun: 0,\n      actionCd: 0.32,\n      moving: true,\n      invincible: 0\n    }\n  ],\n  tickets: [\n    {\n      id: 64,\n      bay: 0,\n      recipe: [Array],\n      patience: 61.86666666666693,\n      maxPatience: 65,\n      cooldown: 0\n    },\n    {\n      id: 62,\n      bay: 1,\n      recipe: [Array],\n      patience: 60.97666666666774,\n      maxPatience: 65,\n      cooldown: 0\n    },\n    {\n      id: 60,\n      bay: 2,\n      recipe: [Array],\n      patience: 60.21833333333402,\n      maxPatience: 65,\n      cooldown: 1.1333333333333333\n    }\n  ],\n  food: [\n    { id: 65, type: 'C', lane: 0, x: -2.317500000000006, z: -2.5 },\n    { id: 68, type: 'C', lane: 0, x: -5.287500000000001, z: -2.5 },\n    { id: 69, type: 'L', lane: 1, x: -6.2325, z: -0.45 }\n  ],\n  stats: {\n    served: 12,\n    caught: 33,\n    wrong: 0,\n    wasted: 7,\n    dashes: 9,\n    bells: 3,\n    hits: 2\n  },\n  won: true,\n  config: {\n    moveSpeed: 5.5,\n    beltSpeed: 1.35,\n    patience: 65,\n    pressureGain: 1,\n    catchReach: 1.25,\n    timeScale: 1\n  },\n  heat: { lane: 2, active: false, warning: true, t: 7.799999999999365 }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
