{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"agent_message","text":"The single-file build now includes Three.js, Rapier, and its physics runtime, so the finished HTML can open directly without downloading dependencies. The first automated playthrough completed all three rushes and exercised catching, serving, combos, dashes, the bell, and steam hits. I’m moving on to browser, controller, touch, and AI Hub checks.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > inspect.py <<'PY'\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\nroot=Path.cwd().parent\nhtml=root/(Path.cwd().name+'.html')\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n browser=p.chromium.launch(headless=True,args=['--enable-unsafe-webgpu','--enable-features=Vulkan','--use-webgpu-adapter=swiftshader','--autoplay-policy=no-user-gesture-required'])\n page=browser.new_page(viewport={'width':1440,'height':900},device_scale_factor=1)\n page.on('pageerror',lambda e:print('ERROR',e))\n page.on('console',lambda m:print('CONSOLE',m.type,m.text[:500]) if m.type in ['error','warning'] else None)\n page.goto(html.as_uri(),wait_until='load')\n page.wait_for_function('window.__game \"'!== undefined'\"',timeout=60000)\n print(json.dumps(page.evaluate('window.__game.snapshot ? __game.snapshot() : __game'))[:1500])\n page.screenshot(path='title.png')\n if page.evaluate('__game.ready'):\n  page.locator('[data-action=\\\"play\\\"]').click()\n  page.locator('[data-action=\\\"begin\\\"]').click()\n  page.screenshot(path='game.png')\n  print('audio',page.evaluate('__game.audio()'))\n browser.close()\nPY\n/home/micha/.local/share/pipx/venvs/playwright/bin/python inspect.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
